A||||17||deceler8||It had to happen...colored tires...||||1||
Z||000000||deceler8||05-16-2000||02:28 PM||||(COMTEX)     B: BFGoodrich(R) Tires Unveils Custom-Designed Scorcher(TM)<BR>B: BFGoodrich(R) Tires Unveils Custom-Designed Scorcher(TM) T/A(R) Color Tires;<BR>Design Your Own Color Tires at <A HREF="http://www.bfgoodrichtires.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.bfgoodrichtires.com</A>  Access the<BR>Multimedia Internet Press Kit at: <A HREF="http://www.internetpresskit.com/bfgoodrichtires" TARGET=_blank>http://www.internetpresskit.com/bfgoodrichtires</A> <BR> <BR>GREENVILLE,  S.C., May 16, 2000 /PRNewswire via COMTEX/ --  BFGoodrich(R) Tires<BR>today unveiled a new section of its Web site -- Scorcher T/A Online -- where<BR>consumers can purchase customized color tires directly from Scorcher T/A Online.<BR> <BR>Consumers can choose two colors from a palette of eight and decide where they<BR>want each color applied to the tire. The color choices include blue, light<BR>green, orange, orchid, purple, red, teal and yellow.<BR> <BR>"BFGoodrich brand raised the bar for performance tires last year when we<BR>introduced the Scorcher T/A to the world. It is a tire that truly lets you feel<BR>and see its traction advantage," said Mathew Aaron, brand manager for BFGoodrich<BR>Tires. "Not only are we raising the bar again, but we're redefining the<BR>tire-buying experience through on-line, customized tires."<BR> <BR>Consumers can log onto <A HREF="http://www.bfgoodrichtires.com," TARGET=_blank>www.bfgoodrichtires.com,</A>  design their own set of Scorcher<BR>T/A tires, place the order, and be finished within five minutes. The tires will<BR>be delivered to a tire dealership of choice or directly to the consumer's home<BR>in four to six weeks. Delivery time ultimately will be as short as two to three<BR>weeks, according to Aaron. Initially, custom Scorcher T/A tires will be sold<BR>only to residents of the United States.||||reg||1
